SUMMARY:Shakeout — 5 km
DESCRIPTION:5 km very easy + 4 × 10–12 s relaxed strides if desired.\nPace: No pace target\; finish fresher than you started.\nHR: Use HR as a cap/secondary check\, not a target. No threshold inference from HR alone.\nRecovery: Full walk/jog recovery after optional strides.\nTerrain: Flat/gentle\; avoid technical descents.\nPurpose: Stay loose without adding fatigue before race day.\nIf fatigued: Rest instead if soreness changes mechanics or pain is focal/worsening.
