BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:bad-ischl-2026-09-27@local-running-coach
DTSTAMP:20260905T131742Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260927
SUMMARY:Race — 25.1 km
DESCRIPTION:Race day: 3 km warm-up + drills/strides\, Bad Ischl HM\, 1 km cool-down only if desired.\nPace: Goal pace ~3:33/km. Open controlled\; pace by effort on hills/wind and avoid banking time early.\nHR: HR is observational\, not a pacing target. Use chest strap if comfortable\; ignore anomalous values.\nRecovery: No interval recovery. Fuel/hydrate according to rehearsed practice.\nTerrain: Bad Ischl HM course\; arrive familiar with turns and gradients.\nPurpose: Execute the primary race after a progressive\, intensity-preserving taper.\nIf fatigued: If illness\, focal pain\, or medical concern is present\, do not force the start.
CATEGORIES:RUNNING,RACE
